 [MacのFinderで今開いているディレクトリをGhosttyで開く https://zenn.dev/kawarimidoll/articles/753e9987863f6e]
 	Raycastに移植して便利に使っているところ
 	[2026-03-10 - 2026-03-16] のneovimでAIエージェント用のプロンプト書くやつの応用
code:finder_to_ghostty.bash
 #!/usr/bin/env bash
 # Required parameters:
 # @raycast.schemaVersion 1
 # @raycast.title Open Ghostty
 # @raycast.mode silent
 
 # Optional parameters:
 # @raycast.icon 🤖
 # @raycast.packageName Open Ghostty
 
 set -euo pipefail
 
 osascript \
   -e 'tell application "Finder" to set cwd to POSIX path of (target of front window as alias)' \
   -e 'tell application "Ghostty"' \
   -e 'activate' \
   -e 'set conf to new surface configuration' \
   -e 'set initial working directory of conf to cwd' \
   -e 'new window with configuration conf' \
   -e 'end tell'
 

